-- FK + index parity supplement (Prisma ownership sprint).
-- Derived from the reference schema's post-data (information_schema).
-- Baseline (0_baseline) creates the 37 tables but, because the domain uses
-- soft-FK scalars (ADR-0008), generates almost no FK constraints/indexes.
-- This migration adds referential integrity + FK-column indexes.
--
-- CAVEATS (see docs/prisma/FK_PARITY_REPORT.md):
--  * All FKs are NO ACTION (DB-level integrity only).
--    Cascade/set-null behavior is enforced in the application layer; parent deletes with
--    children are REJECTED unless the app deletes children first.
--  * On PRODUCTION data, run an orphan-cleanup pass BEFORE this migration
--    (ADD CONSTRAINT fails if any orphan rows exist).

